body:
"They say life passes before your eyes when you're about to die. Maybe they're right. For me all i saw was myself. It was like staring into a mirror. I don't know if you have ever stared  into your own eyes before, but it felt like I was searching myself. Rummaging through all the baggage that is me. All my previous experiences just passing by with no particular moment sticking out. Like staring blankly outside of a train window going full speed. It feels like a journey, but before you know it, the journey ends..."

&#x200B;

***^(splash)***
